**完整示例（可直接查看、可比对）**：
```json
{
  "piece_id": "piece-a01",
  "piece_type": "A资产件",
  "checks": {
    "compliance": {"verdict": "PASS", "evidence": "骑行动作全员头盔"},
    "consistency": {"verdict": "PASS", "evidence": "角色串逐字取自角色卡"},
    "quality": {"verdict": "PASS", "evidence": "无解剖硬错误与水印"}
  },
  "checked_at": "2026-11-25"
}
```
**可复用模板（占位符版，供执行期复制）**：
```json
{
  "piece_id": "<PLACEHOLDER>",
  "piece_type": "<PLACEHOLDER>",
  "checks": {
    "compliance": {"verdict": "<PLACEHOLDER>", "evidence": "<PLACEHOLDER>"},
    "consistency": {"verdict": "<PLACEHOLDER>", "evidence": "<PLACEHOLDER>"},
    "quality": {"verdict": "<PLACEHOLDER>", "evidence": "<PLACEHOLDER>"}
  },
  "checked_at": "<PLACEHOLDER>"
}
```
填写纪律：① 示例与模板的字段集/层级必须一致；② 示例必须自包含可查看（JSON 须合法可解析、表格须有表头+≥1 行数据）；③ 无格式交付物时显式写 `none-justified（理由）`，禁留空；④ 示例的 `vc_refs` 至少映射 1 个已存在 VC（Rule 113.4）。
